--- !u!1001 &234755440
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4613828026226185999, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '1st November 1969


        I don''t understand. I did everything right
        this time. All those sacrifices and for what.


        The shape, the glyphs,
        they are all correct so why doesn''t it work? Why am I powerless the one
        time it matters.


        All three candles lit yet another failure. It
        must be those, monsters, they have cursed me.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544921937658798171, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
