      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '7th October 1969


        All this tinkering isn''t helping my progress.
        Perhaps I do deserve some rest once in a while. But then again, there are
        more important things.


        But really, who knew connecting those old
        mechanisms to a chessboard could be so easy. '
