    - target: {fileID: 4613828026226185999, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '"The Cherrygrove Gazette" 4th August 1950 Issue


        "Chief of
        the Cherrygrove Police Department, Robert Johnson reveals new findings in
        pursuit of serial killer."


        "Our killer has gotten less careful
        recently, we managed to find text on the walls in the home of the latest
        victim,"


        "who new that ultraviolet light could reveal so much for
        this case, the Chief stated in a recent conference."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
